    <section id="news" class="container mx-auto w-full" aria-label="From the MDZ">
      <h2 class="frontpage-h2">From the MDZ</h2>

      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6 sm:mb-12 p-3"
        style="background-image: url(data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAIAAAACCAYAAABytg0kAAAAGXRFWHRTb2Z0d2FyZQBBZG9iZSBJbWFnZVJlYWR5ccllPAAAABZJREFUeNpi2r9//38gYGAEESAAEGAAasgJOgzOKCoAAAAASUVORK5CYII=);"
      >
        <div>

<img
  src="https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v2/fbb40357-26c1-4d78-9d39-44b9978caacc/full/400,/0/default.jpg"
  alt="Scannen mit dem Münchner Finger"
 
 
  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
/>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 sm:px-6 sm:py-4 bg-white">


<p>

The Munich DigitiZation Center (MDZ) has been providing the rich holdings of the Bavarian State Library (BSB) on the Internet since 1997. 
</p>

<p>

It is the 

<strong>central innovation and also production unit of the BSB</strong>

 for developing, testing and implementing new products and processes related to the multifaceted, far-ranging subject of the 'digital library'.
</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul id="short-news">
        <li class="sm:mt-4">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-lg">
            <div class="mt-4 sm:mt-0 text-2xs text-theme-600 leading-4">
              07/24/2026
            </div>
            <div class="flex pb-4 border-b border-theme-200 w-full">
              <div class="w-full">
                <h3
                  class="mb-2 text-sm sm:text-lg font-serif font-bold leading-normal break-words"
                  id="news-0"
                >

Valuable 15th-century french chronicle digitized
                </h3>
                <div class="hidden sm:block flex-grow">


<p>

The valuable French parchment manuscript 'Chroniques de France (commonly known as de Sainct-Denis), tome 1', catalogued as BSB Cod.gall. 4, was digitized at the ScanningCenter. This chronicle of French history dates from the 15th century and contains numerous miniatures.
</p>

<p>

<a href="/en/view/bsb00164625?page=1">To the chronicle in the Digital Collections</a>
</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="hidden sm:flex text-sm clearfix">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-40 mb-4 sm:ml-8">
                  <div class="border border-theme-100">

<figure aria-labelledby="news-0">

<img
  src="https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v2/12cd24fc-bd56-4784-bd3c-f7795ebc4ac7/full/200,/0/default.jpg"
  alt=""
 
 
 
/>
</figure>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="sm:mt-4">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-lg">
            <div class="mt-4 sm:mt-0 text-2xs text-theme-600 leading-4">
              07/24/2026
            </div>
            <div class="flex pb-4 border-b border-theme-200 w-full">
              <div class="w-full">
                <h3
                  class="mb-2 text-sm sm:text-lg font-serif font-bold leading-normal break-words"
                  id="news-1"
                >

13th-century manuscript digitized
                </h3>
                <div class="hidden sm:block flex-grow">


<p>

The valuable 13th-century manuscript ‘Ordo divini officii cum constitutionibus canoniae S. Nicol. (in fine mancus)’ (BSB Clm 16104 a) was digitized at the ScanningCenter.
</p>

<p>

<a href="/en/view/bsb00162750?page=,1">To the Manuscript in the Digital Collections</a>
</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="hidden sm:flex text-sm clearfix">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-40 mb-4 sm:ml-8">
                  <div class="border border-theme-100">

<figure aria-labelledby="news-1">

<img
  src="https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v2/9d23b3d1-9f25-4e35-8e25-b000e6952249/full/200,/0/default.jpg"
  alt=""
 
 
 
/>
</figure>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="sm:mt-4">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-lg">
            <div class="mt-4 sm:mt-0 text-2xs text-theme-600 leading-4">
              07/24/2026
            </div>
            <div class="flex pb-4 border-b border-theme-200 w-full">
              <div class="w-full">
                <h3
                  class="mb-2 text-sm sm:text-lg font-serif font-bold leading-normal break-words"
                  id="news-2"
                >

Artist's Book by Henri Matisse (1869–1954)
                </h3>
                <div class="hidden sm:block flex-grow">


<p>

The work 'Jazz’ by Henri Matisse has been digitized at the ScanningCenter. The valuable artist’s book was published in 1947. It features color paper-cut illustrations as well as accompanying texts by the artist and is considered one of the most significant works of book art of the 20th century.
</p>

<p>

<a href="/en/view/bsb00164518?page=,1">To the work in the Digital Collections</a>
</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="hidden sm:flex text-sm clearfix">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-40 mb-4 sm:ml-8">
                  <div class="border border-theme-100">

<figure aria-labelledby="news-2">

<img
  src="https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v2/b1ff5bea-ad57-47a3-b94e-d3ac94872566/full/200,/0/default.jpg"
  alt=""
 
 
 
/>
</figure>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
